<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Notifications</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #e5e7eb;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 24px 0;
  }
  .app {
    width: 390px;
    min-height: 844px;
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  /* Header */
  .header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 20px 20px 16px;
  }
  .back-btn {
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    border: none; background: transparent; cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #111827;
    transition: background .15s ease;
  }
  .back-btn:hover { background: #f3f4f6; }
  .back-btn:focus-visible, .mark-all:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #0f766e; outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .header h1 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111827;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  /* Toolbar */
  .toolbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 8px 20px 20px;
  }
  .unread-count {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #6b7280;
  }
  .mark-all {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffffff;
    background: #111827;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background .15s ease, transform .15s ease;
  }
  .mark-all:hover { background: #1f2937; }
  .mark-all:active { transform: scale(.98); }
  .mark-all[disabled] { background: #9ca3af; cursor: default; transform: none; }
  /* Notification list */
  .list {
    padding: 0 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .empty {
    text-align: center;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 48px 24px;
    display: none;
  }
  .notif {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    background: #f5f5f5;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    transition: opacity .2s ease, background .2s ease;
  }
  .notif.read { background: #f9fafb; }
  .unread-dot {
    width: 9px; height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #0f766e;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 6px;
    transition: opacity .2s ease;
  }
  .notif.read .unread-dot { opacity: 0; width: 9px; }
  .notif-body { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .notif-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .notif-msg {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #4b5563;
  }
  .notif-time {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app">
    <header class="header">
      <button class="back-btn" aria-label="Go back">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M19 12H5"/><path d="M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
      <h1>Notifications</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="toolbar">
      <span class="unread-count" id="unreadCount">1 unread</span>
      <button class="mark-all" id="markAll">Mark all as read</button>
    </div>

    <section class="list" id="list" aria-label="Notification list">
      <article class="notif" id="notif1">
        <span class="unread-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="notif-body">
          <h2 class="notif-title">Booking Request Sent</h2>
          <p class="notif-msg">Booking request sent to Dr. Rajesh. Waiting for reception to confirm.</p>
          <p class="notif-time">1 min ago</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <p class="empty" id="empty">You're all caught up — no new notifications.</p>
  </div>

<script>
  const btn = document.getElementById('markAll');
  const notif = document.getElementById('notif1');
  const count = document.getElementById('unreadCount');
  const empty = document.getElementById('empty');
  let unread = 1;

  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (unread === 0) return;
    unread = 0;
    notif.classList.add('read');
    count.textContent = 'No unread';
    btn.textContent = 'All read';
    btn.setAttribute('disabled', '');
    setTimeout(() => { empty.style.display = 'block'; }, 300);
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
```

## Audit Verdict: **PASS**

**1) Title/header clarity — PASS.** The back arrow + bold "Notifications" heading at 18px is a standard, unambiguous mobile pattern. Users know exactly where they are and how to leave.

**2) Row layout quality — PASS.** The unread dot, title, two-line message, and timestamp are cleanly stacked in a left-aligned column inside a soft gray card. No overlap or clipping at 390px; the message wraps naturally with adequate line-height, and spacing between title, message, and time-ago creates a clear hierarchy.

**3) Readability of secondary text — PASS (borderline).** The message (`#4b5563`) and timestamp (`#6b7280`) grays are medium-contrast and readable at their sizes. On a white card background, the timestamp at 13px sits near the minimum comfortable size — acceptable, but I'd avoid going lighter than `#6b7280` (e.g., no `#9ca3af`).

**4) Design restraint for healthcare — PASS.** Excellent restraint: monochrome palette with a single teal unread accent, generous whitespace, no decorative imagery, and a low-stress single notification. The dark "Mark all as read" pill is prominent but not alarming — appropriate for a context where overstimulating reds/badges can cause anxiety.

**Minor suggestions (non-blocking):**
- Add a subtle empty-state message after marking all read.
- Consider a slightly darker timestamp shade (`#52525b`) for accessibility headroom.
- The "Mark all as read" button could disable/de-emphasize when there are zero unread items.
